  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "税费扣除后的微薄工资就是成长资源，需要用剩余薪水购买卡牌强化战斗能力。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "In order to survive against increasingly powerful enemies, you’ll need to use what remains of your meager salary after taxes and other expenses are deducted to purchase cards and develop your combat capabilities.",
